WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.514
Tom followed Dirk into the Royal Bedroom.

2
00:00:13.515 --> 00:00:16.260
The queen glared at Dirk.

3
00:00:16.261 --> 00:00:19.719
He was still wet.

4
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:24.793
"This isn't bath day," the queen said.

5
00:00:24.794 --> 00:00:28.878
"I . . . ," Dirk tried to explain. "Well—"

6
00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:32.277
"Never mind." The king looked at Tom.

7
00:00:32.278 --> 00:00:35.353
"Wizard, I can't sleep at night."

8
00:00:35.354 --> 00:00:38.374
The queen sighed.

9
00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:41.343
"The king keeps me awake too.

10
00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:44.268
He needs a magic spell."

11
00:00:44.269 --> 00:00:46.717
Tom stepped forward.

12
00:00:46.718 --> 00:00:48.968
Dirk stuck out his foot.

13
00:00:48.969 --> 00:00:50.818
And Tom tripped!

14
00:00:50.819 --> 00:00:54.475
"Oops!" Tom said.

15
00:00:54.476 --> 00:00:57.038
Dirk grinned.

16
00:00:57.039 --> 00:01:00.233
"I have an idea, Your Majesties!"

17
00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:02.399
Everyone looked at him.

18
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.310
Dirk had an evil smile.

19
00:01:05.311 --> 00:01:09.424
"Tom is a wonderful wizard," he said.

20
00:01:09.425 --> 00:01:11.884
"He can make a magic drink.

21
00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:16.119
A drink to help the king sleep!"

22
00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.270
Everyone looked at Tom.

23
00:01:19.271 --> 00:01:21.808
"Do it!" the king ordered.

24
00:01:21.809 --> 00:01:23.582
Tom bowed.

25
00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:29.078
"Um . . . Yes, Your Majesty."

26
00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:31.164
Tom bit his lip.

27
00:01:31.165 --> 00:01:35.915
Everyone was watching him!

28
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:41.531
Inside his pocket Cat purred softly.

29
00:01:41.532 --> 00:01:45.428
"Just try a spell," she said.

30
00:01:45.429 --> 00:01:47.511
Tom lifted his wand.

31
00:01:47.512 --> 00:01:52.795
He cleared his throat. "King, do not weep.

32
00:01:52.796 --> 00:01:55.466
You'll soon have your sleep!"

33
00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:57.352
Poof!

34
00:01:57.353 --> 00:02:02.299
"Oh no!" The queen gasped.

35
00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.633
"I'm not asleep!" the king yelled.

36
00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:14.655
Tom blinked in surprise.

37
00:02:14.656 --> 00:02:22.378
There were dozens of sheep!

